            <ArticleTitle>Infracalcaneal heel pain in the athlete.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>503-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Heel-spur syndrome is a condition encountered on a daily basis by those practitioners who primarily treat athletes. The authors discuss anatomy, the clinical examination, radiographic evaluation, exercise, and alternative medicines.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
